stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Active: L1 atomic capacity hold
  Active --> Confirmed: L2 order confirmed
  Active --> Expired: L3 slot hold timeout
  Active --> Released: L4 payment failed, slot changed, cancelled
  Active --> ReviewRequired: L5 payment ambiguous
  Expired --> ReviewRequired: L6 late successful payment
  ReviewRequired --> Confirmed: L7 reconciled and capacity held before cutoff
  ReviewRequired --> Released: L8 failed, or cutoff passed (exception case)
  Confirmed --> Released: L9 cancelled or rescheduled before cutoff
  Confirmed --> Used: L10 delivery attempted in this slot
